# GEMINI_API_KEY is intentionally NOT packaged into the APK (see P0-3).
# Users enter their own key in Settings; it is stored locally on device.
# The Secrets plugin ignoreList blocks this key from BuildConfig even if set.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY: OPTIONAL.
# Google Books is used for catalogue metadata only (description, cover,
# categories). The API works without a key, but anonymous quotas are low, so
# supply one if you hit 429s. Get it from
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and enable "Books API".
# Never commit the real value: put it in local.properties (untracked) or in
# your environment. The build reads it into BuildConfig.GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY.
# GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=MY_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY
